  "description": "Core SVG parsing and rendering for ZXUI.Svg. Pure .NET library — only dependency is SkiaSharp. Loads SVG files (polyline / polygon / line + viewBox), exposes SkiaSharp SKPicture / SKPath, and renders to PNG bytes / files / SKCanvas. Use directly in console / server / Unity apps, or pair with a UI binding (ZXUI.Svg.Avalonia for Avalonia). Target framework: net10.0.",
  "id": "ZXUI.Svg.Core",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-02T14:50:47.877Z",
